{"title":"2019 CIME I Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>In parallelogram <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/5/42501e1c7100f340da9bd452bf942219ac6b131b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> the circumcircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/f/12f372757d55c2d07adc720932c6d6e1396aa389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" /> has center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and intersects lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21c1fa17457c16ebb5ce4d408eb858974fb47143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /> respectively<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d52dd46b7fc4df2f724b5af4311a675147cd6e8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.$\" width=\"3\" height=\"2\" /> Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> be the midpoints of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c53cc93aa43cc55bea0dc2511833fe6bdda020f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AO$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/394a09127351f604ebc21e87412150da4fc6a43d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"34\" height=\"16\" /> respectively<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/2/d52dd46b7fc4df2f724b5af4311a675147cd6e8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.$\" width=\"3\" height=\"2\" /> Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/3/4d3f52b2949dc26fb24fb26a4f401a786db22b15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> and the height from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/7/b17ce6fcb2994d4241d780dd5311d828db133411.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> Find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/5/135f302b8bfdb650890f050d3731b25e15a0575b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BF \\cdot DE.$\" width=\"75\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>